  "'auf eine Stelle' is the everyday form; 'um eine Stelle' is also correct but sounds formal and slightly old-fashioned.": "'auf eine Stelle' é a forma do dia a dia; 'um eine Stelle' também está correto mas soa formal e um pouco antiquado.",
  "'auf etwas aufpassen' means watching or looking after it. Use this only where leaving the items briefly is sensible and safe.": "'auf etwas aufpassen' significa tomar conta de alguma coisa. Usa-o só onde deixar as coisas um momento seja sensato e seguro.",
  "'auf etwas aufpassen' means watching or taking care of it. 'darauf' refers back to the object already mentioned.": "'auf etwas aufpassen' significa vigiar alguma coisa ou tomar conta dela. 'darauf' remete para o objeto já mencionado.",
  "'auf etwas stehen' — to be into something. Informal, current, and used constantly.": "'auf etwas stehen' — curtir alguma coisa. Informal, atual e usado a toda a hora.",
  "'Auf etwas stehen' = to be into something. Informal fan talk; works for genres, bands, and people.": "'Auf etwas stehen' = curtir alguma coisa. Fala informal de fã; serve para géneros, bandas e pessoas.",
  "'auf Holz klopfen' — said while literally doing it, after tempting fate.": "'auf Holz klopfen' — dito enquanto se faz literalmente, depois de tentar a sorte.",
